    <briefdescription>
<para>Tracks multi-hop move operations to detect cycles and issues. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For complex scenarios where objects are moved through multiple functions/types, tracks the chain to detect:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Circular moves (A moves to B, B moves back to A)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Premature destruction in move chain</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Unbalanced move operations </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
